; --- done: put the motion settings back ---
; leaving these raised would apply to the next G28, and sensorless homing
; detects a stall from back-EMF - a hard acceleration ramp can mimic one
M220 S100
M201 X1250 Y1250
M204 P1250 T1250 R1250
M203 X400 Y400
